# A tiny adventure: collect 3 gems and dodge the monster.
background is green
hero is a 🧙 at left, size 44
🧱 is solid
make a 🧱 at 400, 110
make a 🧱 at 400, 160
make a 🧱 at 400, 340
make a 🧱 at 400, 390
👾 chases hero 1.2
make a 👾 at right
gems is 0
hearts is 3
show "💎 {gems}/3   ❤️ {hearts}" at top left
repeat 3 times:
    make a 💎 at random place
hero says "Find 3 gems!"

when left key is pressed: move hero left 6
when right key is pressed: move hero right 6
when up key is pressed: move hero up 6
when down key is pressed: move hero down 6

when hero touches 💎:
    add 1 to gems
    remove that 💎
    play coin sound
    if gems is 3:
        hero says "I did it!"
        play win sound
        stop

when hero touches 👾:
    subtract 1 from hearts
    play hit sound
    hero goes to left
    if hearts is 0:
        hero says "Oh no!"
        play lose sound
        stop
